{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787774734,"nonce":"gKtFeNfbk26SFrUXRtD0rCRMZes=","title":"docs(adr): ADR-0060 org settings — connection mgmt + org/env secret editing","message":"\u003e Imported from pull request #71 (MERGED)\n\u003e Branch: `docs/adr-0060-org-settings` → `main`\n\u003e Created: 2026-07-24T09:32:46Z · Merged: 2026-07-24T09:55:35Z\n\n\nAdds **ADR-0060 — Org settings surface** (Proposed): the design for a global Settings area covering forge **connection management** and **org/environment secret editing**. Design-only; no implementation in this PR.\n\nProduced from a `grill-with-docs` session against CONTEXT.md and ADRs 0014/0024/0037/0046/0049.\n\n\n- **Single implicit Org.** Keep `Org` as the RBAC/secret inheritance root (do *not* collapse the concept); surface it as one global `/settings` area, `Administer`-gated, no org switcher.\n- **Secret editing is unified, matrix-as-editor.** Org secrets in Settings; repo + environment secret *values* edited in the Project Secrets tab via the ADR-0037 effective-status matrix (columns = `Repository default` + per-env; set-here / inherited / unset). Environments tab stays rules-only. `SecretScope::Repo` is not renamed — \"repo\" stays the user word, Project the governance concept.\n- **Full connection lifecycle.** Key finding: a Project *is* a `forge_repos` binding (no `projects` table), and only the GitHub install webhook binds today — so **Forgejo is currently unusable** despite ADR-0046. GitHub = observe / re-sync / deep-link (the App is managed on github.com); Forgejo = in-product create → bind repos → register webhooks.\n- **IaC-or-UI connections, single-owner precedence.** Config-declared connections are authoritative and read-only in the UI (\"managed by configuration\"); UI-added connections write the token through to a `_forge` secret ref. One credential-resolution path (env-override → `SecretProvider`), generalizing today's `SCARAB_GITHUB_APP_PEM`. No dual-write.\n- **Deferred:** org RBAC / member-management UI → recorded in `docs/followups.md`.\n\n\n- `docs/adr/0060-org-settings-connections-and-secret-management.md` (new)\n- `docs/adr/README.md` — index row\n- `docs/followups.md` — deferred org-RBAC section\n\n\nBroken into 6 tracer-bullet slices on git-bug (label `ready-for-agent`): Settings shell + org secrets · editable secret matrix · `/v1/connections` read + GitHub observe · Forgejo connection create · Forgejo bind→Project + webhooks (the payoff) · IaC config + single-owner.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}